LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=ObstacleMode" "Parent=Move: Path" "Priority=Normal" "Type=string" "Desc=Specifies how obstacles are handled during the execution of the task" "Value=None"   "Display=Choices:None;;Wait&&Visible:MotionMode!=Default" 
