LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=LateralReplanningLimit" "Parent=Move: Path" "Priority=Detailed" "Type=double" "Desc=Specifies the maximum lateral distance in mm that the AMR could deviate from its base path during a replanning event." "Value=2500" "Max=3000"  "Display=Visible:MotionMode=Dynamic&&Visible:MotionMode!=Default" 
