LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=ReplanningTriggerTime" "Parent=Move: Path" "Priority=Detailed" "Type=double" "Desc=Specifies the time in seconds to trigger a replanning event.  Measured as the elapsed time from when the AMR comes to a complete stop." "Value=1" "Max=300"  "Display=Visible:MotionMode=Dynamic&&Visible:MotionMode!=Default" 
LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=SeamlessMotionMode" "Parent=Move: Path" "Priority=Normal" "Type=string" "Desc=Optimizes motion when possible to reduce unnecessary stops in the AMR trajectory.  Requires Cycle Time Optimization License to activate." "Value=None"   "Display=Choices:None;;Queuing&&Visible:MotionMode!=Default" 
