LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=importance level" "Parent=play" "Priority=Detailed" "Type=string" "Desc=Importance level for this item. Other tasks may cancel this item to play sound or speech with a higher importance level." "Value=Normal"   "Display=Choices:Most Important;;More Important;;Normal;;Less Important;;Least Important" 
LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=cancel less important" "Parent=play" "Priority=Detailed" "Type=bool" "Desc=Cancel other unplayed sound and speech items that have a lower importance level than this item." "Value=true"  
LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=repetition time threshold" "Parent=play" "Priority=Detailed" "Type=double" "Desc=Don't perform this task if a task with the same sound or speech content was performed within this many seconds. Use this to avoid annoying repetition of the same speech or sound playback. Use 0.0 to always perform the task." "Value=0"  
