LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: ArgDesc "Name=repetition time threshold" "Parent=sendSound" "Priority=Detailed" "Type=double" "Desc=Don't perform this task if a task with the same sound or speech content was performed within this many seconds. Use this to avoid annoying repetition of the same speech or sound playback. Use 0.0 to always perform the task." "Value=0"  
LogInfoStrip: TaskInfo: TaskDesc "Name=sendSoundInstant" "Desc=Send sound from a robot sound file to all clients, and continue immediately." "Class=ClientAudio|Instant"
