LogInfoStrip: CustomInfo: ConfigParam "Name=SecondsSinceEpochMonotonic" "Parent=Data Log Settings" "Priority=Expert" "Type=bool" "Desc=Log monotonic timestamps as the number of 'seconds.milliseconds' since epoch (00:00:00 UTC, Jan 1, 1970). (The monotonic time since boot is added to the offset between epoch and boot time that is calculated when ARAM starts. These timestamps will never decrease during a run, but may leap forward or backward between runs.)" "Value=false"  
