LogInfoStrip: CustomInfo: ConfigParam "Name=SADriveMode" "Parent=Docking" "Priority=Normal" "Type=string" "Desc=" "Value=Normal"   "Display=Visible:UseSelectableAutonomy=true&&Choices:Normal;;Smooth;;Precise;;Fast&&" 
LogInfoStrip: CustomInfo: ConfigParam "Name=SATranslationalSpeed" "Parent=Docking" "Priority=Normal" "Type=double" "Desc=" "Value=1400" "Max=1800"  "Display=Visible:false" 
