LogInfoStrip: CustomInfo: ConfigParam "Name=Port" "Parent=GuideSensor_Rear" "Priority=Expert" "Type=string" "Desc=Port the guide sensor is on" "Value=/dev/ttyUSB10"   "Display=Visible:AutoConnect=true" 
