LogInfoStrip: CustomInfo: ConfigParam "Name=LaserAutoConnect" "Parent=Laser_5" "Priority=Expert" "Type=bool" "Desc=Laser_5 exists and should be automatically connected at startup." "Value=false"   "Display=Checkbox" 
